WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.380
- Welcome back everybody.

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.600
We have run out of time,
but there's just enough left

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.770
for one last great story.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.025
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.025 --> 00:00:07.180
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.270
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.000
So earlier we had, somebody
in here is a soprano,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.200
and they were like, wow!

00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:15.810
Y'all can hear it.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.760
Earlier, I like it, vocals.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.700
Earlier, we had Giada De
Laurentiis on the show,

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.460
and she's one of the most
successful chefs on television,

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.800
but hot on her heels is a
little girl from Florida

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.870
who hopes to follow in her footsteps.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.430
At nine-years-old,

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.590
she's already selling her homemade gnocchi

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:35.375
and get this, she's a published
author, so no big deal.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:36.208
(audience clapping)

00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:37.770
Let's get this little chef in here.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.743
Say hi to Sadie, watching
on WESH 2 News at 3.

00:00:41.806 --> 00:00:43.331
(audience cheering)

00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:44.164
Hello.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:46.770
How you doing, Sadie?

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.990
I hear cooking runs in your family.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:50.040
- Yes, it does.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.740
My Gigi used to make gnocchi

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.575
and that's how we all
learned how to make gnocchi.

00:00:55.575 --> 00:00:59.820
I even started my own business
called Sadie's Gnocchis.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.040
I sell gnocchi locally.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.670
I even sell gnocchi to
my teachers at my school.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.760
My goal is to be a chef like Giada.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.530
- Oh, I love that.

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.330
Well, tell us about the book.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.400
There's a reason you wrote it, right?

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.480
- Yes.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.280
My book is called "Sadie's Journey:

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.440
How a Young Girl Cooks Her Way to Italy."

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:20.910
It's on Amazon now.

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:21.743
I wrote it

00:01:21.743 --> 00:01:24.870
because I want another way
to earn money to go to Italy.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.827
I also wrote it so kids my age

00:01:26.827 --> 00:01:30.270
could know that they can do anything too.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.100
- I love that.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:35.460
Sadie, you're so rock and
roll for such a young lady.

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.450
I love you so much.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.740
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:38.881
I hope you get to Italy.

00:01:38.881 --> 00:01:40.145
(audience clapping)

00:01:40.145 --> 00:01:41.578
- [Sadie] Thank you.

00:01:41.578 --> 00:01:43.620
- All right, and that's not all, Sadie.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:46.320
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:47.970
the go-to pen of The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.700
are inspired by your
writing and want to help you

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.620
with your goal of reaching Italy.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:53.850
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.635
for $1,000 to help out.

00:01:55.635 --> 00:01:57.782
(audience cheering)

00:01:57.782 --> 00:01:58.615
- Yay!

00:01:58.615 --> 00:02:00.399
Thank you so much.

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:01.598
- I love it.

00:02:01.598 --> 00:02:03.583
I can see your legs kicking.

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:05.580
All right, thank you so much, Sadie.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:06.934
And thank you to all our guests this hour,

00:02:06.934 --> 00:02:10.378
Mindy Kaling, Dove Cameron,
Giada De Laurentiis,

00:02:10.378 --> 00:02:12.378
Chris Culver and Noah Kahan.

00:02:12.378 --> 00:02:13.211
Y'all have a great day,

00:02:13.211 --> 00:02:14.690
and if it's not, try and change it.

